  {
   "id": "text-125",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 3428,
   "width": 1108.8000000000002,
   "height": 105.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1113963314,
   "version": 3,
   "versionNonce": 809585015,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1794673287432,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Forward one step any time; back one step only with a note.\n• Can't leave Received until contact, amount, transfer date, account no., scam type and 1 document exist (422 MISSING_REQUIRED_INFO).\n• Close from any open stage: withdrawn (operator/supervisor) · rejected (supervisor) · paid_out (supervisor, from Payout Review only).\n• Deadline state on every read: on_track · due_soon (≤2 days) · overdue · none.  AI suggestions never change a case until a person accepts them.\n• Victims (reference + access code) edit contact details until Closed; report details only while Received (409 CASE_LOCKED).\n• The case assistant answers only from the published bluebook of the case's own bank; questions it can't answer go to staff.",
   "originalText": "• Forward one step any time; back one step only with a note.\n• Can't leave Received until contact, amount, transfer date, account no., scam type and 1 document exist (422 MISSING_REQUIRED_INFO).\n• Close from any open stage: withdrawn (operator/supervisor) · rejected (supervisor) · paid_out (supervisor, from Payout Review only).\n• Deadline state on every read: on_track · due_soon (≤2 days) · overdue · none.  AI suggestions never change a case until a person accepts them.\n• Victims (reference + access code) edit contact details until Closed; report details only while Received (409 CASE_LOCKED).\n• The case assistant answers only from the published bluebook of the case's own bank; questions it can't answer go to staff.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
